#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:181
#: parts/javadebugger/javadebuggerpart.cpp:171
msgid ""
"Step over\n"
"\n"
"Executes one line of source in the current source file. If the source line "
"is a call to a function the whole function is executed and the app will stop "
"at the line following the function call."
msgstr ""
"Step bo\n"
"\n"
"Voer uit een lyn van bron in die huidige bron lêer. As die bron lyn is 'n "
"roep na 'n funksie die volledige funksie is uitgevoerde en die app sal stop "
"na die lyn volgende die funksie roep."

