msgid "Step over Ins&truction"
msgstr "Step bo Instruksie"

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:190
msgid "Steps over the next assembly instruction"
msgstr "Stappe bo die volgende saamstel instruksie"

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:192
#: parts/javadebugger/javadebuggerpart.cpp:177
msgid "Step &Into"
msgstr "Step Binnein"

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:195
#: parts/javadebugger/javadebuggerpart.cpp:181
msgid "Steps into the next statement"
msgstr "Stappe binnein die volgende stelling"

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:196
#: parts/javadebugger/javadebuggerpart.cpp:182
msgid ""
"Step into\n"
"\n"
"Executes exactly one line of source. If the source line is a call to a "
"function then execution will stop after the function has been entered."
msgstr ""
"Step binnein\n"
"\n"
"Voer uit presies een lyn van bron. As die bron lyn is 'n roep na 'n funksie "
"dan word uitvoering sal stop na die funksie het al ingevoerde."

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:202
#: parts/javadebugger/javadebuggerpart.cpp:188
msgid "Step into I&nstruction"
msgstr "Step binnein Instruksie"

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:205
#: parts/javadebugger/javadebuggerpart.cpp:192
msgid "Steps into the next assembly instruction"
msgstr "Stappe binnein die volgende saamstel instruksie"

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:207
#: parts/javadebugger/javadebuggerpart.cpp:194
msgid "Step O&ut"
msgstr "Step Uit"

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:210
#: parts/javadebugger/javadebuggerpart.cpp:198
msgid "Steps out of the current function"
msgstr "Stappe uit van die huidige funksie"

#: parts/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:211
msgid ""
"Step out of\n"
"\n"
"Executes the application until the currently executing function is "
"completed. The debugger will then display the line after the original call "
"to that function. If program execution is in the outermost frame (i.e. in "
"main()) then this operation has no effect."
msgstr ""
"Step uit van\n"
"\n"
"Voer uit die aansoek totdat die huidiglik uitvoer van funksie is klaar. die "
"ontfouter sal dan word vertoon die lyn na die oorspronklike roep na wat "
"funksie. As program uitvoering is in die buitenste raam (i.e. in hoof()) dan "
"word hierdie operasie het nee effek."

